{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicColumn",
    "description": "MOSAIC's gas-particle partitioning over a whole column, every size section of every grid cell at once (WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_therm.F: SUBROUTINE ASTEM with its opening aerosol_phase_state passes, aerosolmtc, ASTEM_non_volatiles and ASTEM_semi_volatiles' flux formation; SUBROUTINE mesa and the thermodynamics ASTEM_flux_wet and mesa_flux_salt call), assembled from components that carry the cell axes [lev, bin] and from per-bin physics lifted pointwise over them. It is the right-hand side of the semi-volatile and non-volatile condensation at a given state, plus the MESA salt rates; ASTEM's and mesa_ptc's integrations and the Kelvin fixed-point loop are solvers and are not written here (CLAUDE.md: numerical solvers belong to EarthSciIntegrator).\n\nWHAT IS COMPUTED, per bin, from the cell (T, p, RH, the five condensing gases) and the bin's totals, number, wet diameter and hysteresis water:\n- Lg (mtem_binary_log_gamma.esm, [lev]): the binary MTEM log10 gamma at relhumclm (FORTRAN_BUGS N118).\n- Const (mosaic_gas_equilibrium_constants.esm, 0-D, lifted over lev): the gas-liquid and gas-solid constants, K_w and Keq_ll(1) from the cell's temperature, and Kp_nh4no3_0 / Kp_nh4cl_0 from its temperature and relhumclm.\n- Ps (aerosol_phase_state.esm): MESA's branch (path) at the bin's water activity, and on the analytic branches the phase, the solid/liquid partition, the water and the Kelvin factors. On path 6 (mesa_ptc) it takes MESA's outcome -- mesa_state, from mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm's all_solid / all_liquid at MESA's solid, and water_mesa, the ZSR water of MESA's liquid -- and forms the state, water and Kelvin factors from it.\n- Eq (mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm): at MESA's solid, the solid's ions, the liquid by mass balance, MOSAIC's all-solid / all-liquid classification and THE MESA SALT RATES dE_s/dtau = S - 1 (exposed as Column.mesa_rate on path-6 bins, 0 elsewhere): the rates whose bounded steady state is the equilibrium couplings/mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.esm states.\n- I2E, Zsr, Act (ions_to_electrolytes.esm, aerosol_water_zsr.esm, mtem_activities.esm): the liquid electrolytes, the liquid water at the bin's water activity and the molalities, activity coefficients and activities -- from MESA's liquid on path 6 and aerosol_phase_state's on the analytic branches (Column.liq_in), as ASTEM_flux_wet and mesa_flux_salt recompute them.\n- Rates (astem_rate_assembly.esm) with Mtc (gas_particle_mass_transfer.esm, lifted over lev x bin x gas), Liq, Sol and Mix (astem_liquid/solid/mixed_surface_equilibrium.esm, lifted over lev x bin; Sol read at mixed = Rates.route_mix): kg, each bin's surface equilibrium and rates by jaerosolstate, daer[lev, bin, gas] into each bin and the gas tendencies dgas[lev, gas] with their balances, exactly as couplings/mosaic_astem_rates.esm wires them -- there with the phase state and activities given, here computed.\nThe Column model holds the glue: the selection of the partition by branch (mesa, liq_in, elec_s, aer_s, aer_l), mesa_state, and mesa_rate.\n\nWHAT IS GIVEN (the states the solvers decide): ah2o_a, the bin water activity, the unknown of the Kelvin equilibrium (couplings/mosaic_kelvin_equilibrium.esm), and elec_s_mesa, the solid electrolytes, the unknown of the MESA equilibrium (couplings/mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.esm; read on path 6 only). A complete MOSAIC step also needs the wet diameter dp_wet that aerosolmtc forms kg with: it is calc_dry_n_wet_aerosol_props' diameter after ASTEM's OPENING phase-state pass, while the fluxes are formed at the state after ASTEM_non_volatiles' recompute (operator splitting inside ASTEM), so it is an input here rather than Ps.dpmv.\n\nASTEM_flux_mix (route_mix bins) is wired in but the chem170 column never reaches it, so no column test asserts it (couplings/mosaic_astem_rates.esm does, on hand bins). NOT HERE: ASTEM's state edits inside the flux routines and its solver decisions (see couplings/mosaic_astem_rates.esm), the coupled Kelvin-MESA solve (the nested equilibrium is stated by the two equilibrium documents above; solving them together over the column is EarthSciIntegrator's), the move of particles between sections, and the MOSAIC steps before and after ASTEM (nucleation and coagulation are separate components; the gas chemistry and the transport are other columns).\n\nTESTS: whole columns (59 levels x 8 sections) of the chem_opt = 170 single-column run, at the state ASTEM's first semi-volatile sub-step forms its fluxes at, from ONE capture (dumps/chem170_mosaic_astem and the ASTEM tape; tools/fill_mosaic_column_tests.py), real64, rel 1e-9, flags exactly, all at t = 0 on an empty time_span. Per bin: the branch and jaerosolstate (472 of 472 per column, MESA's classification included), the water and the five Kelvin factors, the solid electrolytes of the analytic branches, kg; on every bin ASTEM formed a liquid flux for at its own state, the liquid ions, the H+/NH4+/NO3-/Cl- molalities, gam(HNO3), gam(HCl), gam_ratio and the NH4NO3/NH4Cl activities; and on every level whose eight fluxes were formed at one state, each bin's rates, the gas tendencies and the balances. Excluded, and why: a bin whose mesa_ptc call hit its 80-pass cap (the last step moves the solid after the last water), or whose last mesa_flux_salt call dissolved a small salt AFTER forming the water (mesa_dissolve_small_salt; FORTRAN_BUGS N121): there the Fortran's water and Kelvin factors belong to a liquid it has already left, which ASTEM_flux_wet then recomputes for the water but not for the Kelvin factors; a level with such a bin, or with a state edit between bins, has no rate assertions; mc(jc_h) of a sulfate-poor case-3 liquid, which ASTEM_flux_wet_case3 replaces by its own root before the tape sees it; gam_ratio of a sulfate-poor liquid without NH4NO3, which compute_activities leaves stale. The MESA salt rates are wired and evaluated but asserted only in couplings/mosaic_mesa_salt_rates.esm (the ASTEM capture has no mesa_ptc tape).\n\nIndex sets: lev (NLEV = 59 cells), bin (NBIN = 8 sections), gas (H2SO4, HNO3, HCl, NH3, MSA), ion (SO4, NO3, Cl, NH4, MSA, CO3, Na, Ca, OIN), el / solv (NEL electrolytes), salt (NSALT soluble salts), sp (the liquid species SO4, NO3, Cl, NH4, MSA, Na, Ca), aer (NAER species), pc, mdrhcurve."
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 59,
      "description": "Grid cells of the column (59 model levels in the chem_opt = 170 single-column run)."
    },
    "NBIN": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 8,
      "description": "MOSAIC size sections per cell (nbin_a; 8 in chem_opt = 170)."
    },
    "NEL": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 22,
      "description": "MOSAIC electrolytes."
    },
    "NZSR": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 19,
      "description": "Electrolytes that hold water, the first nsalt + 4."
    },
    "NSALT": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 15,
      "description": "Soluble salts."
    },
    "NAER": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 112,
      "description": "MOSAIC aerosol species per bin (chem_opt = 170)."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NLEV"
    },
    "bin": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "gas": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 5
    },
    "ion": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 9
    },
    "el": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "solv": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "salt": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NSALT"
    },
    "sp": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 7
    },
    "aer": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NAER"
    },
    "pc": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 6
    },
    "mdrhcurve": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 63
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "Ps": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/aerosol_phase_state.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "I2E": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/ions_to_electrolytes.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Zsr": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/aerosol_water_zsr.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Lg": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mtem_binary_log_gamma.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV"
      }
    },
    "Act": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mtem_activities.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Eq": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Rates": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/astem_rate_assembly.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Mtc": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/gas_particle_mass_transfer.esm"
    },
    "Const": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mosaic_gas_equilibrium_constants.esm"
    },
    "Liq": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/astem_liquid_surface_equilibrium.esm"
    },
    "Sol": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/astem_solid_surface_equilibrium.esm"
    },
    "Mix": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/astem_mixed_surface_equilibrium.esm"
    },
    "Column": {
      "variables": {
        "t_k": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 290.0,
          "description": "Air temperature t_k of each cell (real32 promoted)."
        },
        "p_atm": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "atm",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 0.9,
          "description": "Pressure p_atm of each cell."
        },
        "rh_pc": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "percent",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 60.0,
          "description": "Relative humidity in percent, rh_pc = 100 relhumclm formed in default REAL (aerosol_phase_state.esm)."
        },
        "relhum": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ],
          "default": 0.6,
          "description": "Relative humidity relhumclm as a fraction, the water activity mtem_compute_log_gamz is evaluated at (FORTRAN_BUGS N118: relhumclm, not rh_pc*0.01)."
        },
        "gas": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "gas"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "The five condensing gases of each cell on the gas axis: H2SO4, HNO3, HCl, NH3, MSA (gas(1:ngas_ioa))."
        },
        "num": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1/cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1000.0,
          "description": "Number concentration num_a."
        },
        "dp_wet": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-05,
          "description": "Wet diameter dp_wet_a the mass-transfer coefficients are formed with (calc_dry_n_wet_aerosol_props after ASTEM's opening phase-state pass; operator-split, see the description)."
        },
        "aer_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "aer"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total species aer(:, jtotal) (after conform_electrolytes)."
        },
        "elec_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total electrolytes electrolyte(:, jtotal) as conform_electrolytes left them."
        },
        "water_hyst": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "water_a_hyst: the upper-leg water of the previous MOSAIC step, 0 on the lower leg (aerosol_phase_state.esm)."
        },
        "ah2o_a": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.5,
          "description": "THE KELVIN STATE: the bin water activity, the unknown of the Kelvin equilibrium (couplings/mosaic_kelvin_equilibrium.esm); given here."
        },
        "elec_s_mesa": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "THE MESA STATE: the solid electrolytes, the unknown of the solid-liquid equilibrium (couplings/mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.esm); given here, and read only where aerosol_phase_state hands the bin to mesa_ptc (path 6)."
        },
        "ps_path": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Ps.path, the MESA branch."
        },
        "ps_aer_l": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "aer"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Ps.aer_l, the liquid of the analytic branches."
        },
        "ps_aer_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "aer"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Ps.aer_s."
        },
        "ps_elec_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Ps.elec_s."
        },
        "eq_a_l": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "sp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Eq.a_l_state, MESA's liquid by mass balance (totals less the solid's ions)."
        },
        "eq_a_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "sp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Eq.a_s, the ions of MESA's solid."
        },
        "eq_all_solid": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Eq.all_solid."
        },
        "eq_all_liquid": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Eq.all_liquid."
        },
        "eq_flux": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "salt"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: Eq.flux, MESA's rate dE_s/dtau = S - 1 with its switch-offs."
        },
        "liq": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "sp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Coupling target: I2E.a, the liquid species ions_to_electrolytes leaves (CaSO4 removed), sp order SO4, NO3, Cl, NH4, MSA, Na, Ca."
        },
        "mesa_state": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "The phase mesa_ptc's equilibrium gives a bin at MESA's state (mesa_convergence_criterion's classification, mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm): 1 all solid, 2 all liquid, 3 mixed. Read by aerosol_phase_state on path 6 only."
        },
        "mesa": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "1 where aerosol_phase_state hands the bin to mesa_ptc (path 6): its solid-liquid partition is MESA's."
        },
        "liq_in": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "sp"
          ],
          "description": "The liquid species handed to ions_to_electrolytes (ASTEM_flux_wet, mesa_flux_salt), sp order: MESA's liquid by mass balance on path 6, aerosol_phase_state's liquid (aer indices 1-5, 108, 109) on the analytic branches."
        },
        "so4_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid SO4 as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "no3_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid NO3 as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "cl_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid CL as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "nh4_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid NH4 as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "msa_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid MSA as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "na_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid NA as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "ca_liq": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Liquid CA as ions_to_electrolytes leaves it."
        },
        "elec_s": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "description": "The solid electrolytes of the state: MESA's on path 6, aerosol_phase_state's otherwise."
        },
        "aer_s": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "ion"
          ],
          "description": "The solid ions of the state, ion order SO4, NO3, Cl, NH4, MSA, CO3, Na, Ca, OIN: on path 6 the ions of MESA's solid with CO3 and OIN, which are always solid, at their totals; aerosol_phase_state's solid otherwise."
        },
        "aer_l": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "ion"
          ],
          "description": "The liquid ions, ion order, as ions_to_electrolytes leaves them (CO3 and OIN are never liquid)."
        },
        "mesa_rate": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "salt"
          ],
          "description": "THE MESA SALT RATES: dE_s/dtau = S_s - 1 of the bins mesa_ptc decides (mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm flux at MESA's state), 0 elsewhere. Their steady state, with E_s >= 0, is the solid-liquid equilibrium EarthSciIntegrator solves (couplings/mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.esm)."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "mesa_state",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": ">",
                "args": [
                  "eq_all_solid",
                  0.5
                ]
              },
              1.0,
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": ">",
                    "args": [
                      "eq_all_liquid",
                      0.5
                    ]
                  },
                  2.0,
                  3.0
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "mesa",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "==",
                "args": [
                  "ps_path",
                  6.0
                ]
              },
              1.0,
              0.0
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "liq_in",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b",
              "s"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              },
              "s": {
                "from": "sp"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": ">",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "mesa",
                        "k",
                        "b"
                      ]
                    },
                    0.5
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "eq_a_l",
                    "k",
                    "b",
                    "s"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "ifelse",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "==",
                      "args": [
                        "s",
                        6
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "ps_aer_l",
                        "k",
                        "b",
                        108
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "ifelse",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "==",
                          "args": [
                            "s",
                            7
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "ps_aer_l",
                            "k",
                            "b",
                            109
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "ps_aer_l",
                            "k",
                            "b",
                            "s"
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "so4_liq",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "no3_liq",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
